# ShubhMart Windsurf Rules

Before work, read `AGENTS.md`, `MEMORY.md`, and `RULES.md`. Confirm the current branch and inspect the relevant code before editing.

- Treat all project safety boundaries as mandatory.
- Do not modify production data/schema/security policies, deploy, merge, activate real payments/OTP/credit, create paid resources, or change external services without explicit approval.
- No destructive rebuilds or removal of working features.
- Prefer minimal, reversible, tested changes and isolated synthetic fixtures.
- Protect secrets and personal data.
- Report actual evidence, tests, limitations, and PASS / FAIL / BLOCKED / MISSING / UNVERIFIED status. Never claim unverified security.
